<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
<p><strong>Last updated:</strong> July 20, 2026</p>

<p>This Privacy Policy describes how Alexander Zang ("we", "us", or "I")
handles information in connection with the automated SMS text messages sent through this
service.</p>

<h2>1. Scope of this service</h2>
<p>This is a personal, low-volume messaging service. Automated SMS notifications and alerts
are sent only to the account owner's own mobile device. Messages are not sent to any third
parties, and this service is not used for marketing to other people.</p>

<h2>2. Information we collect</h2>
<p>The only personal information involved is the mobile phone number of the account owner,
which is used solely to deliver the automated text messages. We do not collect names,
email addresses, location data, or any other personal information through this SMS service.</p>

<h2>3. How we use information</h2>
<p>The phone number is used exclusively to send the account owner's own automated
notifications and alerts. It is not used for any other purpose.</p>

<h2>4. Sharing of information</h2>
<p>We do <strong>not</strong> sell, rent, share, or otherwise disclose the phone number or
any message content to third parties for marketing or promotional purposes. Message content
is transmitted through our SMS provider, Twilio, solely to deliver messages to the account
owner's device. No mobile information is shared with third parties or affiliates for
marketing or promotional purposes.</p>

<h2>5. Message frequency and rates</h2>
<p>Message frequency varies based on the automated triggers configured by the account owner.
Message and data rates may apply, depending on the account owner's mobile carrier plan.</p>

<h2>6. Opt-out</h2>
<p>The account owner may stop receiving messages at any time by replying <code>STOP</code>
to any message. Replying <code>HELP</code> returns basic help information. Because the
account owner is the sole recipient, opt-in and opt-out are controlled entirely by the
account owner.</p>

<h2>7. Data retention and security</h2>
<p>We retain only the information necessary to operate the service and take reasonable
measures to protect it. Message delivery and storage on the carrier and provider side are
subject to Twilio's own policies.</p>

<h2>8. Contact</h2>
<p>Questions about this Privacy Policy can be directed to: alexfxzang@gmail.com.</p>

